  m_text: "You washed up on an island and they whoever they are put you in this Prison!
    You need to survive and escape this hell.\n\nThere seems to be monsters all around
    you and what's worse something is controlling them all. Maybe killing it is your
    path to freedom. \n\nYou need to fight your way through and kill anything that
    stands in your way.\n\nStart by searching for something to protect yourself and
    kill some monsters while you're at it.\n\nThe things you may find will appear
    in your Equipment. Use them wisely."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
